OL,3,AAndy Burnham arrives in NI for first
OL,4,Avisit as prime minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has arrived in Northern
OL,7,FIreland for his first visit since he
OL,8,Fbecame prime minister.
OL,10,FThe Labour leader will spend time in
OL,11,FBelfast hearing from young people
OL,12,Fbefore meeting Stormont's first and
OL,13,Fdeputy first ministers.
OL,15,FBurnham is also due to meet leaders
OL,16,Ffrom the Northern Ireland Assembly's
OL,17,Fmain parties, during which Downing
OL,18,FStreet said he would encourage
OL,19,F"problem-solving, not points-scoring".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
